                "# First time setup\n",
                "This code is used to set up the course environment for MA12002. You only need to follow these instructions the *first time* you log in to the Notable server for this course.\n",
                "\n",
                "## Step 1:\n",
                "Click on `Kernel` $\\rightarrow$ `Restart & Clear Output` in the menu bar at the top of this window:\n",
                "\n",
                "![picture of Kernel restart]()\n",
                "\n",
                "## Step 2:\n",
                "Execute the following code cell by selecting it and pressing the \"Run\" button from the menu bar:\n",
                "\n",
                "![picture of run button]()\n",
                "\n",
                "Alternatively you can also press the `Ctrl+Enter` keys simultaneously."
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "code",
